# 04-delivery/session-handoffs/

Handoff files written at `end-session`.

| File                 | Purpose                                       |
| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| `latest-session.md`  | Current handoff (overwritten each session)    |
| `sprint-NNN/`        | Per-sprint archived handoffs                  |

Use `.harness/templates/session-handoff-template.md` and schema
`.harness/schemas/handoff.schema.yml`. Keep under
`quality.memory_management.max_latest_session_lines`.

